msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Prepare Unwrap"
msgstr "准备展开"

msgid ""
"Remove all UV maps, seams, sharp edges, and finished UV marks.\n"
"Apply all geometry modifications before resetting for a clean unwrap"
msgstr ""
"移除所有 UV 贴图、接缝、锐边和已完成的 UV 标记。\n"
"在重置前应用所有几何修改，以获得干净的展开结果"

msgid "UV Maps"
msgstr "UV 贴图"

msgid "Choose how to prepare the UV maps"
msgstr "选择如何准备 UV 贴图"

msgid "Remove All"
msgstr "全部移除"

msgid "Remove all existing UV maps from the mesh before preparing for a new unwrap"
msgstr "在为新展开做准备之前，从网格中移除所有现有的 UV 贴图"

msgid "Iso Projection"
msgstr "等距投影"

msgid "Create a default UV isometric unwrap projection for the active mesh"
msgstr "为当前活动网格创建默认的 UV 等距展开投影"

msgid "Skip"
msgstr "跳过"

msgid "Skip editing UV maps"
msgstr "跳过编辑 UV 贴图"

