msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Auto Seams & Unwrap"
msgstr "自动接缝和展开 UV"

msgid ""
"Partitions mesh into charts using greedy merging based on surface planarity.\n"
"Automatically places UV seams at chart boundaries, then optionally unwraps UVs."
msgstr ""
"基于表面平面性使用贪婪合并将网格划分为图表。\n"
"在图表边界处自动放置 UV 接缝，然后可选择性地展开 UV。"

msgid "Predefined settings for common surface types"
msgstr "常见表面类型的预设设置"

msgid "Mechanical objects, hard edges at 30°"
msgstr "机械对象，30°处的硬边"

msgid "Characters, smooth surfaces, no hard edges"
msgstr "角色，平滑表面，无硬边"

msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定义"

msgid "Manually configured settings"
msgstr "手动配置的设置"

msgid "Hard Edge Angle"
msgstr "硬边角度"

msgid ""
"Edges sharper than this are always seams.\n"
"0=disabled (organic mesh like Bunny).\n"
"30°=hard surface with bevels.\n"
"60°=only sharp corners"
msgstr ""
"比此角度更锐利的边缘总是缝合线。\n"
"0=禁用（像 Bunny 这样的有机网格）。\n"
"30°=带倒角的硬表面。\n"
"60°=仅保留尖锐角"

msgid "Quality"
msgstr "质量"

msgid ""
"Controls chart merge aggressiveness. Lower = more islands,\n"
"sharper boundaries (eyes/ears preserved). Higher = fewer islands,\n"
"more distortion. Bunny reference: 0.30→5300 islands,\n"
"0.32→521 islands, 0.35→291 islands, 0.50→57 islands"
msgstr "控制图表合并的激进程度。较低值 = 更多岛屿，更锐利的边界（眼睛/耳朵被保留）。较高值 = 更少岛屿，更多失真。Bunny 参考：0.30→5300 个岛屿，0.32→521 个岛屿，0.35→291 个岛屿，0.50→57 个岛屿"

msgid "Boundary Smoothing"
msgstr "边界平滑"

msgid ""
"How aggressively to smooth chart boundaries after merging.\n"
"Lower = conservative, contours preserved (2 swaps on Bunny).\n"
"Higher = smoother boundaries but may erode fine details like eye contours"
msgstr ""
"合并后平滑图表边界的激进程度。\n"
"较低值 = 保守，保留轮廓（Bunny 上 2 次交换）。\n"
"较高值 = 更平滑的边界，但可能会侵蚀精细细节如眼睛轮廓"

msgid "Min Island Faces"
msgstr "最小岛屿面数"

msgid ""
"Charts with fewer faces than this are absorbed into neighbours\n"
"before seam marking. Cleans up single-face artifacts without\n"
"affecting semantic boundaries. Raise if micro-islands remain"
msgstr "比此数量更少的面会被吸收进相邻区域，在接缝标记之前。清理单面伪影而不影响语义边界。如果仍有微岛屿则提高该值"

msgid "Min Absorb Faces"
msgstr "最小吸收面数"

msgid ""
"Post-seam absorption threshold — islands smaller than this\n"
"are merged into single-neighbour charts after seam marking"
msgstr "接缝吸收后阈值——小于此值的岛屿会在接缝标记后被合并到单个邻居图表中"

msgid "Min Chart Faces (Smoothing)"
msgstr "最小图表面数（平滑）"

msgid ""
"Charts smaller than this are skipped during boundary\n"
"smoothing — prevents tiny islands from being eroded away"
msgstr "小于此值的图表在边界平滑过程中会被跳过——防止微小岛屿被侵蚀消失"

